> Now, on the NCR 810 chip, what settings are valid for Alpha?

This is what I use, but your controller may be different even with
the same chip.

CONFIG_SCSI_NCR53C8XX=y
CONFIG_SCSI_NCR53C8XX_NVRAM_DETECT=y
CONFIG_SCSI_NCR53C8XX_TAGGED_QUEUE=y
CONFIG_SCSI_NCR53C8XX_IOMAPPED=y
CONFIG_SCSI_NCR53C8XX_MAX_TAGS=8
CONFIG_SCSI_NCR53C8XX_SYNC=5
CONFIG_SCSI_NCR53C8XX_SYMBIOS_COMPAT=y

> Some of the
> config help hinted that not all 810 setting work for Alpha,

This will be IO.  Does not matter how you will set it on Alpha it
will be still IOMAPPED.  At least for now.

  Michal


